OL,3,ANorthern Lights stun UK down to
OL,4,AEngland's south coast
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe Met Office has said sightings could
OL,7,Fcontinue to be possible during clear
OL,8,Fskies until Tuesday.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG6/39
