OL,3,ATwelve killed and 300 injured in attack
OL,4,Aon airport in Saudi capital Riyadh
OL,5,
OL,6,FA Saudi-led military coalition later
OL,7,Fvowed to respond to the attack, which
OL,8,Fit called a "war crime" and blamed on
OL,9,FYemen's Houthis.
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG10/39
