OL,5,AMyanmar's army
OL,6,
OL,7,F"People are panicked and frightened,"
OL,8,Fhe explains. "Some people I know have
OL,9,Fbeen taken."
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG12/39
