OL,2,W//%*// //%Q%**,$-.,%,. (,,,,,,,,,,,,,,,
OL,3,ARussian glide bomb attack on
OL,4,AZaporizhzhia kills at least 20 people
OL,5,
OL,6,FUkrainian President Volodymyr Zelensky
OL,7,Fsaid the attacks on Zaporizhzhia were
OL,8,FRussia expressing "its thanks" for a
OL,9,Fdeal announced by US President Donald
OL,10,FTrump last night easing sanctions on
OL,11,FMoscow to import Russian diesel.
OL,13,FHe added that 13 other regions had come
OL,14,Funder attack overnight, arguing this
OL,15,Fdemonstrated Russia took "any easing of
OL,16,Fpressure to mean they can keep
OL,17,Ffighting".
OL,23,APub: 10-OctQpppppppppppppppppppppG14/39
